    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p12::esc1212",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "028c1cdaaa069c96dae45991e707926f340cb4447c1c37c5666d219a421fc134",
      "resource_identity": "2c76478d6e0cd5d66a2899fe8a31d208b8e5af499cba5744c7da0a4367339abd",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "hello",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "hello",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "i need som help, i feel so sad.",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I am sorry to hear that. Is there anything I can do for you? Please tell me what's wrong?",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I think you can talk to me, maybe I will feel a bit better.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I had a breakup with my boyfriend. ",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Feeling depressed, can you give me any advice?",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "For sure, I am happy to talk to you. I am sorry for your breakup. ",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you, but  I do not feel motivated to do anything. What should i do with my feelings?",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Is there anything you want to do right now that helps maybe. For example, to eat something, to listen good music or take small walk in fresh air etc",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can feel you, it must be so hard to you. take your time do not think about a lot",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "when I have bad times, I just want to take a nap. It maybe help you feel better",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I think you are right, maybe i just need to take a pause in my life for now, yeah I like to sleep. Thanks for supporting me. ",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I think I will try what you said today",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Maybe I will watch some movies and then take a nap",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I am happy to hear that. I hope you will feel better soon. ",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you for your support, I really appreciate it",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-15",
          "session_id": "esc1212",
          "session_rank": 1,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You are welcome, I am here for you. ",
          "turn_index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p12::esc894",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "6a0fca983922210142f24acc62a4ff6b992a05b21395355a83733df4c968c7e1",
      "resource_identity": "47f54282b7eeec8b0561fb0ce944d646e88e4269b450c9eceba23497328dda14",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hello, what can I help you?",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I really sad as my partner walked out on me. Any thoughts what could  cheer me up?",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Was there anything that leads to this?",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Not really. I thought everything was ok between us. That is why it kind of struck me.",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That's terrible and unacceptable behavior.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "How long have you been together?",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I have to agree with you-it is unacceptable, considering that he didn't give me any reasons as to why he did it. We have been together for 5 years. ",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That sucks. I wouldn't be able to accept either. ",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Have you talked to your friends about this?",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It is still rather raw,I have mentioned to it to a few of my friends and they deeply symphatise with me but I feel there is nothing much they can do to help me.They are as shocked as me to be honest.",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It is understandable to have that reaction. I agree with you, only us can hep ourselves.",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Have you tried doing activities that help distract you from having negative thoughts?",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Kind of, most of it involves eating loads of ice cream LOL. ",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Haha I feel you, I tend to eat a lot when depressed too. Look, it's treat yourself method. You deserve the best",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "If you can go to the mountain or big lake, I would say try spending a few hours there. Maybe have a mini picnic by yourself and enjoy the nature.",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "That is a brilliant idea,I do love walking and being outdoors. :) ",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "It surely would help me to clear my mind",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Is there anything you have wanted to do but don't have the time? I always want to learn guitar and baking. This is the best time to start that",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "oh yeah, I suppose I have more time now to focus on things I have always wanted to do but never kind of had time for it. I bought a high end photo camera ages ago but never really had a chance to use it properly-I guess it is time to pursue my interest in photography, and spending more time outdoors would be ideal for that!",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "And reading! The list of books I want to read is arm long!",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That's the spirit! I know being treated like that feels horrible. However, I bet you have mourned enough, at the end of the day, a person treats you like that has no respect and you shouldn't waste time on them.",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It's time to invest in yourself, once you become your better version, a better partner will come to you",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I really agree with you- I am worth more than that. It is time to move on, even when it is difficult. The sad side of it is that I probably will never know what I did wrong for things to end like that. Maybe I didn't do anything wrong. That is the question what will always stay with me and that actually is the hardest bit of it all. But... I am not going to delve into it.",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I feel like hitting a jackpot actually hahahaha. I will be walking off those calories I get from ice cream I have been scoffing lately.So I am having the best of both worlds ",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Who said you cannot have the cake and eat it all LOL",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Yes!Actually don't think you did wrong. Reflecting after a relationship is good but don't put all the blame on yourself.",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "You have learned from this relationship too i believe, use that for your next one",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p12",
          "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
          "session_id": "esc894",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I do not intend to. I am usually the kind of person who does blame oneself but I have found it is not right.",
          "turn_index": 27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "candidate_id": "me::mvu_93da68e17d5b3d66bc87c8fa",
